# Architecture docs lens

1. Architecture Decision Records decide; C4 illustrates — diagrams cite decision ids.
2. Decision Matrices are **Working hypothesis (Draft)** until human Accept + research-depth gate.
3. Interface Control Documents under `07-system-design/icd/` — schemas before code.
4. No new containers / languages without an Architecture Decision Record (or mark Proposed).
5. Read `STATUS.md` FREEZE before adding matrices or decisions.
6. Cross-check `PRECODE_MAP.md` and options under `07-system-design/options/`.
